{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:55:52.293195013Z","verse":12,"ref":"ezekiel 33:12","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":33,"translation":"And you, son of man, say to the children of your people: The righteousness of the righteous shall not deliver him in the day of his transgression, and the wickedness of the wicked — he shall not stumble by it in the day of his turning from his wickedness; and the righteous shall not be able to live by it in the day of his sinning.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואתה","gloss":"And you"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"son"},{"surface":"אדם","gloss":"of man"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"say"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"the sons"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"of your people"},{"surface":"צדקת","gloss":"The righteousness"},{"surface":"הצדיק","gloss":"of the righteous"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תצילנו","gloss":"shall deliver him"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"פשעו","gloss":"of his transgression"},{"surface":"ורשעת","gloss":"and the wickedness"},{"surface":"הרשע","gloss":"of the wicked"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יכשל","gloss":"he shall stumble"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"in it"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"שובו","gloss":"of his turning"},{"surface":"מרשעו","gloss":"from his wickedness"},{"surface":"וצדיק","gloss":"and the righteous"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יוכל","gloss":"shall be able"},{"surface":"לחיות","gloss":"to live"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"by it"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"חטאתו","gloss":"of his sinning"}]}